    <item>
      <title>Vela 1.0</title>
      <pubDate>Sun, 22 Nov 2026 16:15:18 GMT</pubDate>
      <sparkle:version>32</sparkle:version>
      <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
      <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
      <description>&lt;p&gt;Vela 1.0 is the first stable release: a fast, private, native Mac browser built on Safari&amp;#x27;s engine, with Claude built in.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Browsing&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Tabs along the top that group similar sites into color-coded groups, plus pinned and private tabs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Scrolling tab bar with hover previews, an all-tabs list, vertical tabs (⌃⌘V) and split view (⌥-click a tab)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Containers (Personal, Work, Shopping, Banking) that keep logins and cookies apart&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Command bar (⌘K), address bar suggestions, link previews, saved workspaces and automatic tab tidy-up&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Bookmarks with live Safari bookmark sync, history, a reading list (⇧⌘D), highlights and notes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Reader mode, read aloud, translate, full-page screenshots (⇧⌘S), dark mode for every site and focus mode&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Video controls and picture-in-picture, web panels for Calendar and Gmail, and custom keyboard shortcuts&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Safari Web Extensions from apps on your Mac, which ask before reading each site&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Claude&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Quick answers right in the address bar, and a side panel that can chat and use your tabs&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Explain or summarize selected text, rewrite what you type, and talk to Claude by voice&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Compare tabs, summarize YouTube videos, check whether a site looks legitimate, and get a weekly report&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Smart bookmarks that Claude sorts into folders, and &amp;quot;find a page I&amp;#x27;ve seen&amp;quot; from your history&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Watch a page and get an alert when it changes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Claude never sees private tabs or pages with a password box, and asks before closing tabs or sending forms&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Privacy and security&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Ad, tracker and pop-up blocking, cookie controls and automatic cookie-banner rejection&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Fingerprinting protection, link tracking removal, Global Privacy Control and email masking&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;HTTPS upgrade with a warning for insecure sites, Google Safe Browsing and download scanning&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Passwords in the macOS Keychain with Touch ID autofill, a password generator and 2FA codes&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Per-site permissions, per-site Lockdown Mode, and a site info and certificate panel&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Music and search&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;A Spotify mini player along the bottom of the window (Spotify Premium)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Image and video search grids from DuckDuckGo&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Good to know&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vela updates itself. Turn on Settings ▸ General ▸ Get beta updates to try new features early.&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Vela isn&amp;#x27;t notarized by Apple, so the first time you open it, right-click Vela ▸ Open (or use System Settings ▸ Privacy &amp;amp; Security ▸ Open Anyway).&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
      <enclosure url="https://github.com/mlovelace112-maker/VelaBrowser/releases/download/v1.0/Vela-1.0.zip" sparkle:edSignature="A5VzuWf8awBMNcDH6qL+MBWfDe1CVIwa33+CwIZWh7GlFs37YgTonA+RycSRgTvlQvwIeny/vUZ40sUuvDv6BQ==" length="9161090" type="application/octet-stream" />
    </item>
